# H8: hand the cards back to production. This is the LAST job of the window and it runs even when a stop job halted the window and after a stall or a
# hang, which are expected to be able to leave all four cards hung with production down: the status of every board and the all-four reset. The driver
# then runs, outside this job file, the platform's fabric re-measure, the :latest retag in the rig daemon's local store (unchanged by this window),
# and placement through the admin API (which needs the user's go-ahead and an admin token); then /v1/models and one chat on the placed endpoint.
# What to place: TODAY'S PRODUCTION RECIPE, the image that served before this window with the profile c2-packed-tp4 (audits off, the pinned sampler in
# the verify trace): never an eight-seat image, NEVER a gate arm (not c2-packed-tp4-8, not c2-packed-tp4-8-gate, -time-gate or -diag-strace, not any
# gate-only profile), whatever this window found. The eight-seat profiles are unserved until a later decision of the user.
# Pass: all four boards enumerate after the reset, the fabric re-measure passes, the endpoint answers /v1/models with the served model name and a chat
# completes, and the engine log shows profile c2-packed-tp4. If the reset does not heal a board after a stall, production stays down until it does.
# Duration (estimate): 15 min. Stop rule: any failure stops the window (it is the last job).
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4-seats8 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/seats8 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. Every value is final except the image tag.
# ORDER.txt says the order, each job's image, its stop rule and its minutes. C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-seats8 is the tag the image build of this branch
# gets; no job here builds (the image is built by a build-only job while production still serves). A commit after that build needs a new
# build and a new tag in every template.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status reset
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-seats8
